  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fas III Social Safety Net</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase III Social Safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let med insatsen &#xE4;r att man i Litauen ska utveckla metoder f&#xF6;r att i m&#xF6;jligaste m&#xE5;n undvika att socialt utsatta grupper s&#xE5;som m&#xE4;nniskor med fysiska eller psykiska handikapp, missbrukare och misshandlade kvinnor med barn beh&#xF6;ver placeras p&#xE5; institution.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to decrease the number of individuals with a physical or mental disability that have to live in institutions. By developing community based social service alternative care will be offered to social risk groups. The project started in 1997 and this decision covers a continued consolidation of 14 pilotcenters as well as an extention to the national level.</narrative>
  </description>
